From 244e8d50eb6a6dad858b660fd930742fd60e5b0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: T0 <dev@local>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 09:00:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] T0: transfers pre-work

Prepares the codebase for the Transactions module (API 4.10) before any
transfer entity exists.

- ProductItem.BranchID becomes nullable (Q4): null = in transit, or in the
  tenant's unassigned pool awaiting a branch at print time. Branch FK made
  explicit as NoAction per ERD 3.3, plus a covering index for pool queries.
- CardStatus.Disposed added (Addendum A). ERD 8 deviation, approved.
- ProductItemService refuses status edits on disposed and in-transit cards,
  and rejects disposal through the status endpoint (F4).
- BatchUploadService refuses to re-sight disposed or in-transit cards,
  reporting them per row rather than failing the file.
- Product.ProductTransactionWay frozen once any card exists (P6).
- AuditSaveChangesInterceptor now resolves real tenant attribution (F2).
- Localization keys added to Messages.resx and Messages.ar.resx.
